mode: "100644"
text: "# Threads growth 2026 — verified\n\n*Volatile. Re-verify quarterly (Threads + Mosseri ship changes often).*\n\n## The POV: conversation-first — grow by replying more than you post\nThreads is **~500M MAU (mid-2026 estimates) / ~141.5M daily mobile users (more than X's ~125M — though X\nstill leads on web + total MAU), with a ~6.25% median engagement\nrate (≈73.6% higher than X's 3.6%)** — and only ~1% of brands post consistently (an open window). It's\n**neither X nor Instagram**: a **conversation-first**, **positive/constructive** culture where **sarcasm,\ndunks, and negativity get throttled.** Mosseri's core advice: **\"reply much more than you post.\"** Replies\nare as valuable as posts, **your own replies to comments count toward the post's total**, and broadcasting\nwithout conversing makes reach plateau.\n\n## The algorithm (account-level)\n- **Multi-model AI** (not one algorithm). **For You = AI-ranked** (an **interest graph**, not a follow\n  graph); **Following = reverse-chronological.** 2026: **\"Dear Algo\"** lets users steer For You in plain\n  language. Loop: gather inventory → read signals → predict (like / reply / follow / profile-visit / keep\n  reading). **Smaller accounts can reach big audiences** here.\n- **Engagement velocity is the #1 ranking factor** — **50 likes in 30 min beats 100 over 24h**; **the first\n  hour is critical** (post and walk away = miss the reply window = tanks distribution).\n- **Replies are weighted heaviest**; **saves + shares + meaningful conversation > raw likes** (50 likes/10\n  saves beats 200 likes/2 saves). **Not all replies are good** — engagement-bait replies are discounted.\n- **Instagram graph cross-pollinates** (following/viewing an IG profile boosts their Threads content) — but\n  **an IG following ≠ automatic Threads success** (different algorithms; earn it here).\n- **Originality + credibility prioritized** (recycled content + growth hacks demoted). **Engagement-bait\n  actively downranked** (asking for likes/follows/shares is penalized). The **Account Status dashboard** tells\n  you if your posts are eligible for non-follower recommendation.\n\n## What wins (format mix — post craft lives in `threads-post`)\n- **Photos get ~60% more engagement** than text-only; **video with captions** performs best; **text-only\n  ranks last.** **Links now ~+17%** vs text-only (Mosseri reversed the penalty in 2025) — still under media.\n- **ONE topic tag per post** (NOT hashtags; Threads limits to one to discourage spam — no multi-tag\n  strategy). Topic-tagged posts get more views + discovery. Natural-language keywords in the **first two\n  lines** help the AI read intent.\n\n## Cadence, niche, timing + the compounding curve\n- **Consistency over volume: 3–5 posts/week** optimal; **>3/day risks fatigue** and splits engagement.\n- **Niche consistency** (1–2 areas) → the algorithm classifies you + the audience trusts you; \"one sharp\n  value promise per audience.\"\n- **Timing:** strong first-hour windows (e.g. Wed 7am, Thu/Fri mornings — verify); post when the audience is\n  awake. **Growth compounds** — most accounts take **60–90 days** of consistent posting before momentum\n  (≈200–500 followers in 30 days for active accounts — verify). **Communities** (post original ideas there\n  first → repurpose) + **DMs** (concierge/VIP) help.\n\n## The Threads → Instagram funnel + metrics\n- **Threads = discovery funnel** (topical reach) → **Instagram = conversion funnel** (deeper engagement,\n  commerce, richer formats). Route attention deliberately; **repurpose top Threads posts within 24–72h.**\n  (Benchmarks, verify: Threads→IG profile-visit conv ~6–12%; keep reply rate above ~2%/post.)\n- **Track weekly:** reach per post, **replies per post (the heaviest signal — track replies ÷ reach)**,\n  follower-growth rate, profile visits. High reach + flat follower growth → the hook/value needs work.\n"
